<div class="rte-content">
    <h3>2026 Election Filings & Filing Packets</h3>
<p>Candidates filing for federal, state, legislative or judicial offices file with the Secretary of the State Election Board at the State Capitol. Candidates filing for county offices file with the secretary of the appropriate <a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/about-us/county-election-boards.html" target="_blank" title="County Election Boards Directory">county election board</a>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>2026 Tulsa Municipal Candidate Filing</strong></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="/media/k2gjthd2/2026-election-packet_tulsa.pdf" target="_blank" title="2026 Tulsa Municipal Filing Packet">Tulsa Municipal Candidate Filing Packet</a></p>
<p>Candidate Filing: June 8 - 10, 2026, 8am - 5pm</p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="/media/jl2h1u2h/tulsa-municipal-filings_061026_5pm.pdf" target="_blank" title="TulMunFil_061026_5pm">List of Candidates - 061026 5pm</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>2026 Board of Education Filings</strong></p>
<p>Candidate Filing: December 1 - 3, 2025, 8am - 5pm; Primary: February 10, 2026; General: April 7, 2026</p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-education-board-candidate-filing-packet.pdf" target="_blank" title="2026 Bd of Ed Filing Packet">Board of Education Filing Packet</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://filings.okelections.gov/ViewCandidates/2025120120251203/72/all" target="_blank" title="Tulsa Co Filings_Bd of Ed Election 2026">List of Candidates - Candidate Filing Portal</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>Municipal Candidate Filings</strong></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2025-candidate-filing-packets/2025-municipal-candidate-filing-packet.pdf" target="_blank" title="Municipal Candidate Filing Packet">Municipal Candidate Filing Information &amp; Filing Packet</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>Municipal Candidate Filing (Charter Municipality)</strong></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/charter-municipality-filing-packet.pdf" target="_blank" title="Municipal Candidate Filing Information &amp; Packet (Charter)">Municipal Candidate Filing Information &amp; Packet (Charter)</a></p>
<p>Candidate Filing: February 2 - 4, 2026, 8am - 5pm; City of Bixby: General: April 7, 2026</p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="/media/r5ypkwes/020426_city-of-bixby_5pm.pdf" target="_blank" title="City of Bixby Filings 020426">List of Candidates 020426 5:00pm</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>2026 County Candidate Filings</strong></p>
<p>Candidate filing will be held April 1-3, 2026 (8 a.m. - 5 p.m.). County candidates will file at the Tulsa County Election Board. Federal, State, Legislative, and Judicial candidates will file at the State Election Board in Oklahoma City.</p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information.html" target="_blank" title="2026 County Candidate Filing Information">Candidate Filing Information for Federal, State, County, and Judicial Candidates</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="/media/0eri4nea/county-filings_04032026_500.pdf" target="_blank" title="County Filings Final">List of Candidates 04/03/2026 Final</a></p>
<p><strong>County Commissioner Filing</strong></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2024-special-county-elections/county-commissioner-filing-packet.pdf" target="_blank" title="Co Comm Filing Packet">County Commissioner Candidate Filing Information &amp; Packet</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/elections/signatures-required/20251101_county-offices-signatures-required.pdf" target="_blank" title="Sig Required by Petition_2026">Signatures Required (if filing by petition)</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>2026 Fire Protection District Candidate Filing</strong></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="/media/dakf1hir/2026-fire-protection-district-candidate-filing-packet.pdf" target="_blank" title="2026 FireProtectionDistrict">Fire Protection District Candidate Filing Packet</a></p>
<p>Candidate Filing: July 6 - 8, 2026, 8am - 5pm; General: November 3, 2026</p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="/media/cbfl0qwd/fpd_berryhill_070826_500pm.pdf" target="_blank" title="FPD_Berryhill_070826_5pm">List of Candidates for Berryhill 07/08/2026 5:00pm</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/elections/forms/withdrawal-of-candidate-ceb.docx" target="_blank">County Candidate Withdrawal Form</a></p>
<p> </p>
</div>
